WEBVTT

1
00:00:08.851 --> 00:00:15.175
Schedule H aur H1 ki davaayein sirf registered
doctor ki prescription par bikti hain.

2
00:00:15.215 --> 00:00:18.768
Medoro yeh niyam billing par hi laagu karta hai.

3
00:00:18.808 --> 00:00:25.431
Search list mein aisi medicines ke saath laal
rang mein Sch H ya Sch H1 likha dikhta hai.

4
00:00:26.204 --> 00:00:28.897
Cefidem 200 ek Schedule H1 dava hai.

5
00:00:28.937 --> 00:00:33.149
Ise cart mein daalte hi Prescription section
khulta hai,

6
00:00:33.189 --> 00:00:36.490
aur likha aata hai: Required for Schedule H.

7
00:00:37.260 --> 00:00:43.460
Bina prescriber details ke bill poora karne ki
koshish karein, to Medoro bill nahi banata.

8
00:00:43.500 --> 00:00:45.678
Yeh check hataaya nahi ja sakta.

9
00:00:46.426 --> 00:00:52.868
Ab doctor ka naam, unka registration number, aur
H1 dava ke liye patient ka naam bhariye.

10
00:00:52.908 --> 00:00:56.729
Is demo mein doctor aur patient, dono kaalpanik
hain.

11
00:00:57.490 --> 00:00:57.884
Ab F9.

12
00:00:57.924 --> 00:01:04.399
Bill ban gaya, aur prescriber ka naam aur
registration number invoice par bhi chhapta hai.

13
00:01:05.164 --> 00:01:11.135
Doctors screen par aap prescribing doctors ka
record rakhte hain: naam, qualification,

14
00:01:11.175 --> 00:01:13.302
registration number aur clinic.

15
00:01:13.342 --> 00:01:18.545
'Sales by doctor' mein har doctor ki
prescriptions se hui bikri dikhti hai.

16
00:01:19.309 --> 00:01:24.028
Schedule H1 ka register 'Books & registers'
screen par hai.

17
00:01:24.068 --> 00:01:29.917
Ismein har H1 dava ki bikri darj hai: taareekh,
invoice, patient, doctor,

18
00:01:29.957 --> 00:01:34.112
registration number, dava, batch, expiry aur
maatra.

19
00:01:34.152 --> 00:01:39.678
Kisi line mein jaankari adhoori ho, to woh laal
rang mein dikhti hai.

20
00:01:40.450 --> 00:01:45.562
CSV button se poora register download kijiye, ya
Print se chhaapiye.

21
00:01:45.602 --> 00:01:49.653
Drug inspector ke maangne par yahi register
dikhaaiye.

22
00:01:49.693 --> 00:01:54.123
Medoro legal check ko bypass karne ka koi raasta
nahi deta.
